==Notes==
*Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
*This feat would give an additional +2 bonus for every 3 Harper scout levels past third, if it was possible to go beyond 5 Harper scout levels. (For the significance of this, see the previous version notes below.)
*The bonus is subject to the +20 [[saving throw]] cap.
*The saving throw bonus is subject to [[dispel|dispelling]]. The effective caster level is the Harper's [[character level]].

===Previous versions===
*Prior to version 1.69, this feat gave an additional +2 saving throw bonus for every 3 levels past third of ''[[champion of Torm]]'' (not Harper scout).

